// The group income and expenditure statement: Statement Amount (the outturn of each line, in the sign the line is
// presented in), Statement Plan (the plan, only on the net resource, net capital and total lines, only where the source
// publishes a plan at that level) and Statement Amount (plan basis) for every statement line and every financial year
// that has either. Spacer lines have no amount and drop out. The expected values are dw.v_statement_pnl.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Statement Line'[Line Id],
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    "outturn", [Statement Amount],
    "plan", [Statement Plan],
    "outturn_plan_basis", [Statement Amount (plan basis)]
)
ORDER BY 'Statement Line'[Line Id], 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year]
